   | <!-- codex-helper-outbox:<marker> --><p><strong>🔧 Helper:</strong></p>
   | <p>I could not process 1 Teams attachment(s): messageReference. Supported inputs are plain text plus Teams-hosted inline/reference file attachments that the current Graph scopes can download. For generated files from Codex, use <code>helper file &lt;relative-path&gt;</code> from the Teams outbound root. Quoted Teams messages in the 🏠 control chat are only supported with <code>ask &lt;question&gt;</code> or natural-language fallback prompts; explicit control commands do not consume quoted context.</p>
